-30T22:43:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9221807718276978,"text_excerpt":"I have never had anything but good experiences at this Walgreens. I love the drive up Rx pickup/drop off. I even got my flu shot at Walgreens. Everyone working there is very helpful and friendly"},{"business_id":"Wm_3y_mVKFqKN4UEBhMx_A","review_id":"aKNPwknLmRMaAbrIOSlyoQ","date":"2015-04-25T18:28:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.920524537563324,"text_excerpt":"This Walgreens and the one on St. Charles Ave are like night and day. I'm really happy I go here now, and I transferred my Rx here. It's so much better. Staff is friendly and courteous--both in the main store and the pharmacy."},{"business_id":"Wm_3y_mVKFqKN4UEBhMx_A","review_id":"ZeQsjqeJ3UvifL97mIe6aA","date":"2013-07-18T05:29:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8938581943511963,"text_excerpt":"I'm giving this Walgreens 5 stars because they actually saved me some money and they didn't have to. I was in the area, so I stopped in because I had to pick up some nail polish and Walgreens is the only one that carries it. I got the name brand nail polish and the Walgreens brand clear coat. When I went to pay, the beauty counter lady told me that the name brand nail polish was 2 for1. So, I was able to get the name brand clear polish instead of the Walgreens brand. Yeah, not a huge deal, but she didn't have to point it out to me. Tip: don't park in the parking lot overnight. You will probably be towed."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Wm_3y_mVKFqKN4UEBhMx_A","photo_id":"hl-VEJ52aTka3edKq8fKqg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hl-VEJ52aTka3edKq8fKqg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8844311237335205},{"business_id":"Wm_3y_mVKFqKN4UEBhMx_A","photo_id":"GNMXEUgZzzq2oCUsDCioKg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/GNMXEUgZzzq2oCUsDCioKg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.884431004524231}]},"notebook_case":null}
